    text: "Alex, Bella, Cyrus, Dara and Evan finished a race in five different positions (1st to 5th). Bella finished immediately after Cyrus. Evan finished after Bella but before Alex. Dara finished in an odd-numbered position. Cyrus did not finish first. Which of the following statements is definitely true?",
