    text: "Four swimmers — Kai, Leo, Mira and Nia — swam a race scored out of 50. If Mira had scored 4 more points she would have scored 90%. Kai scored 6 fewer points than Nia, who scored one and a half times as many points as Leo. Which of the following statements is definitely true?",
